  "instructions": [
    "In a bowl, combine lamb slices with yogurt, crushed cardamom pods, cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, pepper, and olive oil; mix until coated.",
    "Cover and marinate in the refrigerator for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Heat a skillet over medium-high heat and cook lamb for 5-7 minutes until browned and cooked through.",
    "While lamb cooks, warm the keto double-rise flatbread sheets in a dry pan for 1 minute each side.",
    "Prepare the tahini sauce by whisking tahini, lemon juice, minced garlic, and enough water to reach a pourable consistency.",
    "To assemble, lay a flatbread sheet, spread a layer of tahini sauce, add lettuce, cucumber, tomato, and cooked lamb.",
    "Sprinkle chopped parsley over the filling and roll the wrap tightly.",
    "Slice the wrap in half and serve immediately."
